==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|þekkja}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*þankijaną}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*teng-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈθɛhca/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|ɛhca|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|þekkti|þekkt}}

# to [[know]], be [[familiar]] with {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{syn|is|vera kunnur}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég '''þekki''' þennan mann ekki!|I don't '''know''' this person!}}
# to [[recognize]], [[know]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{syn|is|bera kennsl á}}
#: {{ux|is|Geir? Ég '''þekkti''' þig ekki.|Geir? I didn't '''recognize''' you.}}

